Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 10:02:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Solve the uncoupled fields by recursion, and list the
 split solver in the test header

The foreach closure over the tuple of uncoupled fields allocated 1056
bytes per solve on Julia 1.10, where the test asserts zero. A recursion
over the tuple compiles one method per element and captures nothing. The
integration test's header now names item 6.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LA3FukgbRCMkra999BhdDw
